Organism: PendingEncounterLayer
Status: canonical
Role: interactive overlay
Interaction policy: action-required
Exports: lib/features/encounters/presentation/widgets/pending_encounter_layer.dart
Public API: lib/features/encounters/presentation/widgets/pending_encounter_layer.dart

Purpose:
  Presents the trusted Present Cell's pending Encounter and its authored Option before resolving it into a committed Item reward. Gesture ownership is card-only: its Resolve or Retry control owns activation; outside-map gestures neither resolve nor dismiss the card.
